drspace-install — Install Droidspaces OSS kernel configurations.
Usage:
    ./drspace-install <kernel_source_path> <defconfig_path> [--include-optional] [--skip-patch]

Arguments:
    kernel_source_path : path to kernel source tree (contains Makefile)
    defconfig_path     : path to defconfig (e.g. arch/arm64/configs/vendor/lavender-perf_defconfig)

Flags:
    --include-optional  : include optional configurations (UFW/Fail2ban, USER_NS, TMPFS_XATTR, etc.)
